+[2026-11-16] OWNER DECISION - DTO VALIDATION GAP [DEC-2026-11-16-SECURITY-002]
+
+Finding: payments.controller.ts menggunakan @Body() body: any — tidak ada DTO
+    validation. Semua field payload (customerId, amount, method, paidAt,
+    invoiceId) diterima tanpa validasi tipe/format.
+    Attack surface: malformed payload -> error handling inconsistency,
+    potential field mismatch, sulit di-test untuk negative case.
+
+Recommendation: introduce CreatePaymentDto dengan class-validator decorators
+    (atau validator strategy yang konsisten dengan module lain di codebase).
+    Cross-cutting: DTO strategy mungkin perlu ADR tersendiri untuk konsistensi
+    lintas module (customers, packages, invoices, payments).
+
+Scope (future, belum dieksekusi):
+    - CreatePaymentDto definition
+    - class-validator atau pilihan strategy final
+    - Module-wide validation strategy alignment (ADR candidate)
+    - Negative test cases
+
+Supersedes: none
+Related: DEC-2026-11-16-SECURITY-001, commit c06c40e
+
+Status: RECORDED. Backlog item. No implementation authorized. Requires ADR
+    untuk validation strategy sebelum implementasi. Tracked as F-3.
